## Delivery cadence / engineering method

Follow the established OrderHub cadence:

`problem -> evidence/hypothesis -> decision -> alternative -> impact -> validation`

TDD sequence:

`RED -> minimal GREEN -> inspect/refactor -> broader regression gate -> clean checkpoint`

Prefer:

- 4-6 RED/GREEN pairs for independent domain/application/privacy invariants;
- 1-2 RED/GREEN pairs for migration, retention, ingestion consistency or concurrency boundaries;
- one targeted gate plus one broader regression gate per batch;
- exact branch/HEAD/remote/index/working-tree guards before commits/pushes;
- no speculative architecture or technology introduction;
- no commit/push after a failed gate;
- PR review findings must be investigated transparently and resolved only with evidence;
- any remediation that changes HEAD requires required workflows and final review against the new exact HEAD.

